  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The SMMHEP project focuses on bolstering Malawi&apos;s mental health infrastructure through four key initiatives: providing MMed (Psychiatry) training at KUHeS to cultivate qualified psychiatrists, supporting these graduates in leadership roles to enhance service delivery, improving undergraduate mental health education at KUHeS, and implementing a Quality Improvement project at Zomba Mental Hospital and Queen Elizabeth Central Hospital to refine risk management practices.</narrative>
